You are participating in the Interstellar Parliament of Agricultural Advancement, discussing the fusion of advanced genomics with traditional farming practices to enhance food security across galaxies. The conference is hosted on the agricultural hub planet, Agris, known for its innovative blending of science and tradition to achieve remarkable food production sustainability.

